A('1962-0606-bontot', '1962-06', VH, 'The Secretariat opens a campaign in early June to build "four-good" Party cells and committees: good leadership of production, good enforcement of State policy and law, care for the masses\' life and mass work, and good Party building and strengthening.', 'III, 95–96', when='June, early', place='hanoi', check='the day; the history gives the Secretariat and early June. A second campaign of the same months, "three buildings, three oppositions", opened by the Politburo Apr. 26.')
A('1962-0701-nlfdelegation', '1962-06', VH, 'The National Liberation Front\'s delegation under Prof. Nguyễn Văn Hiếu visits Czechoslovakia in June, the Soviet Union in July (and the July 26 celebration in Cuba), Hungary in August, Indonesia in September, China in October (and Algeria\'s national day), and North Korea in November.', 'III, 189', when='June–Nov.', names=['Nguyễn Văn Hiếu'], also=['vietnam'], check='the days; one entry for the tour, as the history gives it by month.')
A('1962-0501-saigon', '1962-05-01', VH, 'Saigon. Tens of thousands of workers of hundreds of unions meet for May Day, May 1: resolutions for higher pay and against firings; 5,000 taxi and cyclo drivers march shouting "Down with the Americans", "Down with Ngô Đình Diệm".', 'III, 187', place='saigon', names=['Ngô Đình Diệm'], also=['vietnam'])
A('1962-0523-court', '1962-05-23', VH, 'Saigon. The special military court sentences 12 men, May 23: four to death, four to life, four to terms of 5 to 10 years. Five thousand students and four thousand parents hold a march of 5 to 6 km at Chợ Lớn and Tân An against the verdict.', 'III, 187', place='saigon', also=['vietnam'], check='the day of the march is not given.')
A('1962-0524-nlfappeal', '1962-05-24', VH, 'The National Liberation Front\'s appeal, May 24, to the people of the South and to the soldiers of the Saigon army to rise against the Americans and their agents.', 'III, 189', also=['vietnam'], tags=['ok:fields-place'], check='the place.')
A('1962-0720-nlf4points', '1962-07-20', VH, 'The Front\'s Central Committee sets four urgent policies for national salvation, July 20: the Americans to halt their war of aggression; all strategic hamlets to be dismantled; a national coalition government in the South; a peaceful, neutral foreign policy.', 'III, 189 n.1', also=['vietnam'], check='the place.')
A('1962-0724-boat1', '1962-07-24', VH, 'Cà Mau. The boat of Tư Mâu, five crew, leaves the Bồ Đề mouth for the North, July 24, sent by Region 9\'s standing committee to report to the Center and ask for ships with arms for the landings prepared.', 'III, 150', place='bo-de', vis=True, also=OP + ['vietnam'])
A('1962-0726-boat2', '1962-07-26', VH, 'Cà Mau. The boat of Bông Văn Dĩa, five crew, leaves Vàm Lũng for the North, July 26.', 'III, 150', place='vam-lung', vis=True, also=OP + ['vietnam'])
A('1962-0730-seized', '1962-07-30', VH, 'Quảng Trị. Off Cửa Việt, July 30, Saigon\'s naval ship Đống Đa 07 seizes Tư Mâu\'s boat and takes it to Đà Nẵng. After more than eight months\' detention the Saigon side learns nothing.', 'III, 150', place='cua-viet', also=OP + ['vietnam'])
A('1962-0801-boat2arr', '1962-08-01', VH, 'Bông Văn Dĩa\'s boat reaches the North, Aug. 1: his second trip north; its crew report in detail to the Center.', 'III, 150', vis=True, also=OP + ['vietnam'], check='the place of landing.')
A('1963-03-trammlac', '1963-03', VH, 'Long An. In early March Saigon uses an infantry task force, an armored troop and Rangers to encircle and take the Trầm Lạc and Ấp Mới area at Mỹ Hạnh, Đức Hòa, and with tanks and bulldozers destroys the fighting works built by the troops, guerrillas and people there; most secret shelters destroyed, the guerrillas unable to hold.', 'III, 275', when='Mar., early', place='tram-lac', also=OP, check='the day.')
A('1963-05-huongthuoc', '1963-05', VH, 'Thủ Dầu Một. In May Saigon\'s 5th Division sweeps three communes southwest of Bến Cát to move the people; guerrillas of Tây An and Phú Thứ ambush the columns on Route 14 at Rạch Bắp and Phú Thứ crossroads, and Company 304 of the province and Company 81 of Bến Cát wipe out the men in the Hương Thuốc church in the Long Cần strategic hamlet.', 'III, 297', when='May', place='huong-thuoc', also=OP, check='the day.')
A('1963-09-caycam', '1963-09', VH, 'Châu Đức. In September a district platoon with some guerrillas ambushes a Ranger battalion at Cây Cám: 38 killed, five weapons taken.', 'III, 294', when='Sept.', place='cay-cam', also=OP, check='the day.')
A('1963-0915-longdat', '1963-09', VH, 'Long Đất. In mid-September the district\'s Company 25 beats a sweep of Civil Guard Battalion 356: 75 out of action.', 'III, 295', when='Sept., mid', place='long-dat', also=OP, check='the day.')
A('1963-10-phuocloi', '1963-10', VH, 'Long Đất. In October Company 25, with guerrillas as guides and men inside, attacks the Phước Lợi strategic hamlet: 12 hard-core officials seized, 13 weapons taken, the hamlet held.', 'III, 295', when='Oct.', place='phuoc-loi', also=OP, check='the day.')
A('1963-10-tantru', '1963-10', VH, 'Long An. In mid-October the troops of Tân Trụ and Bến Lức raid the posts at Tân Bửu, Bình Đức and Mỹ Thạnh and hold their ground against the sweeps to move the people; in the month the province\'s forces destroy dozens of posts and help break 20 strategic hamlets.', 'III, 279', when='Oct., mid', place='long-an', also=OP, check='the day.')
A('1963-11-route15', '1963-11', VH, 'Long Đất. At the end of November the district troops with the village guerrillas ambush on Route 15 a main-force unit sweeping to widen its base and move the people: many killed, among them the subsector chief.', 'III, 295', when='Nov., late', place='long-dat', also=OP, check='the day.')
C('cal.1962-02-27.vietnam', 'III, 190 (8:15 a.m., two AD-6s take off from Biên Hòa, circle the Palace three times; Phạm Phú Quốc and Nguyễn Văn Cử)', 'A')
